## Architecture

```
 ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │  LangServe / FastAPI  (src/server.py)                     │
 └─────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ invoke / stream
 ┌─────────────────────────▼────────────────────────────────┐
 │  LangGraph StateGraph  (src/graph/workflow.py)            │
 │                                                           │
 │   ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌───────────┐  │
 │   │ Orchestrator │───▶│  Researcher  │───▶│ Executor  │  │
 │   │    Agent     │    │    Agent     │    │   Agent   │  │
 │   └──────────────┘    └──────────────┘    └───────────┘  │
 │                                                           │
 │   State: AgentState  ·  Checkpointing: PostgreSQL         │
 └─────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┘
           ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
    ┌──────▼──────┐ ┌──────▼──────┐ ┌─────▼──────┐
    │    Tools    │ │   Memory    │ │  LangSmith │
    │  (web, DB,  │ │  (pgvector) │ │  (tracing) │
    │  code, …)   │ └─────────────┘ └────────────┘
    └─────────────┘
```

## Quick start

```bash
# Install dependencies (uv recommended)
pip install uv
uv pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Copy and fill in environment variables
cp .env.example .env

# Run in dev mode (auto-reload on changes)
uv run dev

# Type-check
uv run typecheck

# Lint + forge conventions
uv run lint

# Test
uv run test
```

## Environment variables

| Variable | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | yes | OpenAI API key for LLM calls |
| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | no | Anthropic API key (optional fallback) |
| `LANGCHAIN_API_KEY` | yes | LangSmith API key for tracing |
| `LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2` | yes | Set to `true` to enable LangSmith |
| `LANGCHAIN_PROJECT` | no | LangSmith project name (defaults to `{{.Name}}`) |
| `DATABASE_URL` | yes | PostgreSQL connection string for checkpointing + pgvector |
| `REDIS_URL` | no | Redis for rate-limiting (optional) |

## CLI shortcuts (Forge)

