## Adding a new agent

1. Create `src/agents/<name>.py` — extend `BaseAgent`.
2. Add the node to `src/graph/workflow.py` via `workflow.add_node(...)`.
3. Wire edges in `build_graph()`.
4. Add tests in `tests/test_<name>.py`.
5. Run `forge ship "add <name> agent"` to spec, test, code, and ship.

## LangSmith tracing

Set `LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=true` and `LANGCHAIN_API_KEY` in `.env`. Every
graph run will be traced automatically. View runs at
[smith.langchain.com](https://smith.langchain.com).
